{"id":"296dbf1277331432","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula.md","title":"ZFC Pi One Formula","display":"df-zfc-pi-one-formula — ZFC Pi One Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula"],"display":"df-zfc-pi-one-formula — ZFC Pi One Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pi-one-formula — ZFC Pi One Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,q,n\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,q,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\)</span> (formula-sequence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (bounded-formula predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}universal\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land q(0)=\\varphi\\land q(n)=\\psi\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\bigl(q(k)=\\forall\\vec x(k)\\;q(k+1)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}universal\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land q(0)=\\varphi\\land q(n)=\\psi\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\;\\bigl(q(k)=\\forall\\vec x(k)\\;q(k+1)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite universal block is represented by a formula sequence, so the assertion contains no variable-length metasyntactic ellipsis. The case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> includes every bounded formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,q,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}universal\\text{-}prefix} \\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land q(0)=\\varphi\\land q(n)=\\psi\\land\\forall k<n\\;\\bigl(q(k)=\\forall\\vec x(k)\\;q(k+1)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pi\\text{-}one\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{PiOneFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{UniversalPrefix}_S(q,\\varphi,\\psi,\\vec x,n,\\Sigma)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1776,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3099","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula.md|58-df-zfc-pi-one-formula]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","2678ecfefaa83e32","36d7463d215be751"]}